{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05854","headline":"送陆员外 · 王维","name":"送陆员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郎署有伊人，居然古人风。\n天子顾河北，诏书除征东。\n拜手辞上官，缓步出南宫。\n九河平原外，七国蓟门中。\n阴风悲枯桑，古塞多飞蓬。\n万里不见虏，萧条胡地空。\n无爲费中国，更欲邀奇功。\n迟迟前相送，握手嗟异同。\n行当对侯归，肯访商山翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}